	'kb6fe7e43' => 'Our clinic is open Monday through Friday from 9:00 to 18:00, with extended evening hours on Thursdays until 20:00 to accommodate working schedules. On Saturdays, Claire Dubois hosts our weekend clinic from 9:00 to 13:00. We are closed on Sundays and public holidays. On the third Thursday of every month at 18:30, we host our free open listening evening. These informal, monthly gatherings provide a relaxed opportunity to meet our audiologists, ask general questions about hearing care, explore acoustic technology, and learn practical strategies for managing conversation in noisy settings.',
	'kb6ff3a27' => 'Mei Lin Hartmann',
	'kb79a7889' => 'Every fee is listed here in euros, before you book.',
