	'kbaebcf77' => '60 minutes, then a plain-language report.',
	'kbb36f886' => 'The problem · Hearing check, 60 min',
	'kbbaff128' => 'Contact',
	'kbc95d396' => 'Jonas Lindqvist',
	'kbee0a8cf' => 'Nothing here yet.',
	'kc04d60ea' => 'The Clinic Space',
	'kc1f9314a' => 'LISTEN',
	'kc4088d33' => 'Preferred day',
	'kc4120d0d' => 'Hearing aid fitting and real-ear verification (2 visits, 14-day home trial)',
	'kc48eef8f' => 'To schedule a consultation, you can call our reception team directly at +00 555 0184 or email hello@shizuka-hearing.example. You may also complete our online booking request form by providing your name, email address, telephone number, preferred appointment day, and a brief message regarding your hearing concerns. Priya Nair will contact you promptly to confirm your appointment time and provide preparation details. We remind patients that we request at least 24 hours of advance notice for any appointment cancellations or schedule changes. We look forward to welcoming you to Harbour Lane.',
	'kc510b33a' => 'Review visits',
	'kc5296522' => 'Mei Lin Hartmann is our tinnitus counsellor, guiding patients through evidence-based sound therapy, acoustic habituation strategies, and lifestyle counselling with patient reassurance. Tomás Reyes is an audiologist who leads our review visits, working closely with adults during their critical two-week, six-week, and six-month milestones to fine-tune sound quality and physical comfort. Claire Dubois is an audiologist who manages our popular Saturday clinic, offering comprehensive hearing checks and diagnostic consultations for patients unable to visit during standard weekday business hours. Together, they provide continuous, attentive clinical support across every appointment.',
	'kc66a1910' => 'In ethical audiology, we must be honest: there is currently no medically proven cure that eliminates tinnitus permanently. However, effective clinical strategies can significantly lessen how intrusive the sound feels. Through our 75-minute tinnitus consultation with Mei Lin Hartmann, priced at €140, we combine acoustic sound therapy, environmental sound enrichment, and habituation counselling. By addressing underlying hearing changes and calming the brain&#x27;s heightened auditory gain, many patients find their tinnitus recedes into the background of awareness, allowing them to relax, work, and sleep peacefully again.',
	'kc689cd64' => 'Patient coordinator',
	'kc6e429b1' => 'The method · Two visits and a 14-day trial',
	'kc6fbcee5' => 'Booking an Appointment',
	'kc6fcd6fb' => 'Hearing aid technician',
	'kc9b37985' => '+00 555 0184<br>hello@shizuka-hearing.example<br>Open listening evening: Thursday 18:30, monthly and free',
	'kcb5971de' => 'Six months after your initial fitting, we invite you back for a comprehensive 45-minute review visit. During this session, we evaluate how your devices are performing across challenging listening environments, review speech clarity, and inspect your ear canals for wax buildup. Subsequent reviews are scheduled on an annual basis to monitor your hearing thresholds and recalibrate device output as your hearing naturally evolves. Individual review visits outside the fitting package are €60 each. Regular monitoring ensures that your hearing aids continue to match your auditory requirements accurately, preserving speech understanding and confidence year after year.',
	'kcc59c768' => 'Minutes in a review visit',
	'kce8ae9da' => 'Email',
	'kcea02844' => 'Who you will meet',
	'kcf8cb85c' => 'Can tinnitus be cured completely?',
	'kcfc76be3' => 'Rooms: 2 consulting rooms and 1 sound booth',
	'kd014653d' => 'Real-Ear Measurement',
	'kd1813ed1' => 'Notes from the clinic',
	'kd214858d' => 'What You Take Home',
	'kd3f8083b' => 'Your appointment begins with an in-depth conversation about your medical history, listening environments, and daily communication challenges. Next, your audiologist performs video otoscopy to inspect your outer ear canals and eardrums for wax or physical irritation. You then step into our calibrated sound booth for pure-tone audiometry, where you listen to gentle tones across various pitches. We explain your results immediately using clear visual charts. You receive a plain-language summary to take home, with no obligation to purchase devices or proceed with further treatment unless you choose to do so.',
	'kd4525806' => 'Follow-Up at Four Weeks',
	'kd54c7808' => 'Dr. Elena Varga is the founder and clinical audiologist at Shizuka Hearing. Having spent years working in hospital ENT departments, she established the clinic in 2014 to ensure patients receive thorough diagnostic attention and unhurried fittings. Alongside her, Samuel Okafor serves as our fitting lead and clinical audiologist. Samuel specializes in complex speech-in-noise testing and precision real-ear measurements, ensuring that device programming perfectly reflects individual ear canal acoustics and real-world communication demands. Both clinicians believe that listening recovery requires compassionate partnership, clinical rigor, and time.',
	'kd5926a99' => 'VISIT &amp; CONTACT',
	'kd9ef37fa' => 'From the first conversation to the review visit',
	'kdb95e480' => 'We recommend bringing your hearing aids in for professional cleaning and acoustic re-tuning every six months, or whenever sound clarity feels diminished. Our 30-minute cleaning service with technician Jonas Lindqvist costs €35 and includes clearing sound bores, replacing wax filters, and checking microphone response. In addition, we advise scheduling an annual clinical review visit for €60 to re-evaluate your hearing thresholds and update device programming. Regular maintenance prevents moisture and wax damage, extends device lifespan, and ensures that you continue enjoying clear, effortless conversation every day.',
	'kdb96a3e3' => 'Hearing care does not end on the day your hearing aids are fitted. Our systematic review schedule ensures your devices adapt smoothly to your lifestyle, maintaining acoustic precision and long-term physical comfort.',
	'kdbf994c3' => 'Ana sings alto in a community choir, where blending vocal harmonies requires acute awareness of neighboring singers and subtle pitch dynamics. Over several months, she struggled to balance the organ&#x27;s volume against vocal cues, leaving her uncertain during rehearsals in the resonant church hall. Working with Dr. Elena Varga, Ana completed speech-in-noise evaluations and was fitted with custom-programmed devices designed to preserve natural musical dynamics without harsh clipping. Now confident in rehearsals and performances, Ana enjoys singing without vocal strain. Please note that experiences differ for every individual, and personal results depend on individual auditory profiles and consistent device use.',
	'kdc588f47' => 'All fees are quoted in Euros (€) and are payable at the conclusion of each consultation by debit card, major credit card, or bank transfer. We provide itemized receipts that you can submit to private health insurance providers where applicable. We operate by scheduled appointments to maintain generous consultation times and keep our waiting room peaceful. If you need to reschedule or cancel an appointment, we kindly ask for at least 24 hours of advance notice. Cancellations made with less than 24 hours of notice may incur a cancellation fee.',
	'kdc7c1b1f' => 'FITTING',
	'kde6bb23f' => 'STORIES',
	'kde844064' => 'Prices in euros',
	'kdf98f2ed' => 'Henrik, 58',
	'ke010ae4a' => 'Ana, 47 — Back in the Choir&#x27;s Alto Row',
	'ke35209b7' => 'HEARING',
	'ke3b2054f' => 'We take a measured, diagnostic approach to hearing care rather than rushing toward quick retail sales. Every patient begins with an unhurried conversation so we understand your daily listening environments, whether that means following speech in lively cafés or hearing colleagues across a conference table. We carry out thorough evaluations in a dedicated sound booth and test how your ears distinguish speech in noise. When fitting hearing aids, we use objective real-ear measurements to ensure sound is calibrated accurately to your ear canal acoustics. Every individual responds differently to amplification, and we work alongside you through every review visit until speech feels natural and intelligible.',
	'ke4819c99' => 'We believe medical pricing should be clear, predictable, and fully transparent before you arrive. All our fees are published in Euros (€) with no hidden extras or unexpected retail surprises.',
	'ke5b24420' => 'VISIT',
	'ke784b333' => 'Hearing Check',
	'kea4bce16' => 'TINNITUS CARE',
	'keade5621' => 'Founded in 2014, Shizuka Hearing is an independent audiology clinic in Northgate dedicated to unhurried hearing care. We believe that regaining clear conversation requires clinical precision, quiet patience, and time.',
	'keb743f76' => 'Since 2014, second floor, Harbour Lane.',
	'kedf86a00' => 'THE CLINIC',
	'kee97c651' => 'BOOK',
	'kef89da81' => 'Payment and Cancellation Terms',
	'kf0202bff' => 'Tinnitus is the perception of sound in the ears or head when no external sound source is present. It frequently accompanies subtle changes in hearing sensitivity, where the brain increases internal auditory gain to compensate for missing auditory signals. During your 75-minute consultation, priced at €140, we conduct thorough acoustic evaluations and examine how tinnitus impacts your sleep, concentration, and emotional well-being. We do not make false claims of miraculous cures, as ethical audiology recognizes there is no single cure for tinnitus. Instead, many people find that with structured support, the sound becomes significantly less intrusive.',
	'kf05b2c82' => 'Tomás Reyes',
	'kf0ae585b' => 'The review visit is where a fitting meets ordinary life. We see you at 2 weeks, at 6 weeks, and at 6 months, then once a year. Each visit is 45 minutes: how conversation is going, a check of the fit, cleaning if it is needed, and a re-tune when the settings should change. The first two of these visits are included with every fitting. Later reviews are €60. A shorter cleaning and re-tune, 30 minutes, is €35 if you need it between reviews. The schedule is a set of return dates so the aid can be adjusted as you use it.',
	'kf3e02b6a' => 'How a fitting works',
	'kf496ab5d' => 'Three people, in their own words.',
	'kf68db52c' => 'Send booking request',
	'kf6aeaee4' => 'How We Work',
	'kf7baa203' => 'Henrik, 58 — Tinnitus Quieter at Night',
	'kf88d3379' => 'THE MISSED SENTENCE',
	'kf8f20728' => 'Where you will be seen',
	'kf931e7e0' => 'Hear the whole sentence.',
	'kfafc8dda' => 'The first two review visits are included with every fitting. Please cancel at least 24 hours ahead.',
	'kfd815462' => 'Even the most advanced hearing instruments require routine technical upkeep to perform reliably in daily life. Moisture, earwax, and dust can gradually clog delicate microphone ports and acoustic receivers. Jonas Lindqvist, our hearing aid technician, performs professional 30-minute cleaning and re-tuning services for €35. During this appointment, we vacuum sound bores, replace wax guards and microphone filters, test battery contacts, and verify acoustic response against baseline curves. Keeping your devices clean and properly maintained prevents unexpected breakdowns, avoids sound distortion, and ensures that speech remains crisp and clear in every conversation.',
